   "source": [
    "# Inspect the categories before filtering\n",
    "category_counts_raw = df_raw[\"category\"].value_counts(dropna=False)\n",
    "category_counts_raw"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "070ba222",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Rows classified as `PARSE_ERROR` or `TIMEOUT` are excluded. These rows do not represent successfully generated programs for which vulnerability can be meaningfully modelled. The target variable is therefore built only from valid program classifications: `VULNERABLE` and `NON-VULNERABLE`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bd4a1986",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Filtering out the `PARSE_ERROR` and `TIMEOUT`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 90,
   "id": "0ba6b63f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Rows before filtering: 1766\n",
      "Rows after filtering: 1565\n",
      "Rows removed: 201\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "VULNERABLE        1513\n",
       "NON-VULNERABLE      52\n",
       "Name: category, dtype: int64"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 90,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "invalid_categories = [\"PARSING ERROR\", \"UNKNOWN (time out)\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "before = len(df_raw)\n",
    "\n",
    "df = (\n",
    "    df_raw\n",
    "    .loc[~df_raw[\"category\"].isin(invalid_categories)]\n",
    "    .copy()\n",
    "    .reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "after = len(df)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Rows before filtering:\", before)\n",
    "print(\"Rows after filtering:\", after)\n",
    "print(\"Rows removed:\", before - after)\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"category\"].value_counts()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0b01d4ac",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 1. Binary outcome"
